  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Bound in dark blue fabric, printed with aqua. Page 1 of cover has title and illustration, page 4 of cover has authors and illustration. Light blue embroidery thread through spine hold central booklet in place. This booklet contains poem, biographies, colophon, and small piece (about 5 x 7 cm) of handmade paper with embossed design and title Púlsares printed in upper case letters in black ink. Page 2 of cover has poem printed in black accompanied by impression prints and some color printing in accordion fold format with a top/bottom orientation. Page 4 of cover has two phrases printed in black at start and finished with impression prints in the pages between in a side-to-side orientation.</subfield>
  </datafield>
